# Git workflow

## Branches

- Never commit design or feature work directly on `main`.
- Branch from latest `main`, push, and merge via PR.
- Use prefixes: `docs/`, `feat/`, `fix/`, `chore/`, `proto/`.

## Commits

- **One line only** (subject, no body by default).
- **English only**.
- Format: `type(scope): summary`
- Keep the summary short and concrete.

```text
# ✅ GOOD
docs(design): add overall IM engine design outline
feat(gateway): accept websocket frame handshake

# ❌ BAD
docs(design): 落地总体设计

docs(design): add design outline

More detail in a second paragraph...
```

## Changelog

- For notable docs/features/fixes, add a short English bullet under
  `CHANGELOG.md` → `## [Unreleased]` (`Added` / `Changed` / `Fixed` / …).
- Do not dump every commit into the changelog.

Do not use `--no-verify` unless the user explicitly asks.
